==Battleground==
*1 [[Capy]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Capy]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*5 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Henry]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.
**8 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The challenge of this stage is that Henry will freeze your cats as they come in, making them unable to do anything. The Dark Otters and Gory Dark can plow through your meatshields while the Capies can kill your expensive, strong cats in a couple of attacks.

When you spawn your expensive units, time them so that they spawn after Henry uses his attack so they can reach his blind spot.

Any units with [[Immune to Freeze|freeze immunity]], notably [[Li'l Tank Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Eraser Cat]], [[Talents|talented]] [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball Cat]], [[Maiden Cat (Rare Cat)|Wrestling Cat]] and certain Ubers can make the stage considerably easier.

